Third-party credit: Hallmark

Deckmark's architecture (Floor, Reflex and Finish gate tiers, frontmatter themes,
a seeded dealer rotated against a project log, a structural draw, a linter that
runs in a real browser, and a fresh-context reviewer) follows Hallmark
(https://github.com/Nutlope/hallmark). Eight themes are adapted from Hallmark
themes of the same name: midnight, vantage, console, newsprint, editorial,
vellum, ink and specimen. A few small helpers in skills/deckmark/scripts are
adapted from Hallmark's scripts. Details are in skills/deckmark/scripts/NOTICE.

